  "goodToKnow": "Der Amokläufer is a rampage killer. School shootings in Erfurt (2002) and Winnenden (2009) shocked Germany and led to tighter gun laws, such as a higher minimum age for owning large-calibre weapons. Der Amoklauf is a killing spree, and Amok laufen means to run amok; the word comes from Malay. Media now often avoid naming perpetrators. The plural is the same."
